@startuml fig4_06_seq_task_proof
!include style.iuml
autonumber
hide footbox

actor "Caregiver" as U
participant "TasksTab\n(mobile app)" as App
participant "TaskDoneView" as API
participant "presence" as P
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

U -> App : tick a task
App -> U : open the camera (no gallery)
U -> App : take the photo
App -> API : POST /api/tasks/<id>/done/\n(photo bytes, image/jpeg)
API -> API : check role, size <= 6 MB,\ntype from first bytes (JPEG, PNG, WebP)
API -> P : require_in_range() -> current_reading(caregiver)
P --> API : state (in / out / unknown), distance
alt not verified within 15 m of the elderly person
  API --> App : 403, nothing is stored
  App --> U : "You are about N m from the elderly person.\nMove within 15 m to mark this done."
else in range
  API -> DB : Task.is_done = true, done_at = now
  API -> DB : create TaskCompletion\n(title, shift, photo, photo_type)
  API -> DB : mark the shift's Chore done
  API --> App : 201 task with completion_id
  App --> U : task shown as done
end
note over App : offline: the tick and photo wait in the\ntask queue and are sent when back online
@enduml
